OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome sunny
OL,6,Fspells will linger across the far
OL,7,Fsouth this evening, but cloud will
OL,8,Fthicken from the west, with outbreaks
OL,9,Fof drizzle developing across much of
OL,10,FEngland and Wales. Temperatures around
OL,11,Faverage but staying warm in the far
OL,12,Fsouth.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FRain will soon clear the
OL,15,Ffar southeast, with sunny spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping widely. Heavy, frequent
OL,17,Fshowers across Scotland will spread
OL,18,Fmore widely through the day, with some
OL,19,Fpotentially turning thundery.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
